{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The locking nut assortment connects to my recent purchases of screws, nuts, and locking washers because it serves a similar fastening purpose.",
    "That connection makes the nuts relevant to consider, although the SAE sizes do not clearly match my recent metric screws, so I would pass now."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Printer filament does not meet the fastening and hanging needs reflected in my recent purchases; buying hardware does not mean I have a 3D printer or a printing project.",
    "Different filament colors and materials give me no additional reason to choose them when I have no current printing need, especially in large quantities."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat an interest in practical hardware as a reason to buy supplies for unrelated making projects.",
    "Repeated filament choices assume that printing supplies are relevant before there is any evidence that I need them."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent magnetic hooks and fasteners point toward securing and hanging things, which matters more to me than a broad connection to tools or projects.",
    "Fastener compatibility matters: an assortment of SAE nuts is not an obvious next purchase for the M3, M4, and M5 metric screws I recently bought."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The nuts partly match my fastening interests, but most recommendations infer a printing need that my recent purchases do not support."
}"}
